  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 722079744
    m_Localized: Horn Charge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 793382912
    m_Localized: When used on a [Water] or [Swamp] tile, gains [Breakthrough] for
      1 turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1511529955060351066
  - m_Id: 793382913
    m_Localized: The conditions are not met, so this skill cannot be used.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84051071995904
    m_Localized: Clone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84051134910464
    m_Localized: Creates a duplicate with the same data on 1 random adjacent empty
      tile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1511529955060351067
  - m_Id: 84051134910465
    m_Localized: The conditions are not met, so this skill cannot be used.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85345065111552
    m_Localized: Degeneration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85345065111553
    m_Localized: Applies [Degeneration] to itself for 1 turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1511529955060351068
  - m_Id: 85345065111554
    m_Localized: The conditions are not met, so this skill cannot be used.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85520307326976
    m_Localized: Multiply
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85520307326977
    m_Localized: Creates 1 [Pawn] of the same race on a random adjacent empty tile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1511529955060351069
  - m_Id: 85520307326978
    m_Localized: The conditions are not met, so this skill cannot be used.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86056217743360
    m_Localized: Synthesis
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86056217743361
    m_Localized: Fuses with 2 adjacent allied pieces of the same type and randomly
      promotes into a [Knight], [Bishop], or [Rook] while retaining its race. Gains
      [Attack Disabled] for 1 turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1511529955060351070
  - m_Id: 86056217743362
    m_Localized: Requires two adjacent allies of the same piece type as yourself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88327840206848
    m_Localized: Jellu Wall
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88327840206849
    m_Localized: Creates 1 neutral [Jellu Wall] piece on the tile directly in front.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1511529955060351071
  - m_Id: 88327840206850
    m_Localized: The conditions are not met, so this skill cannot be used.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88777704476672
    m_Localized: King's Awakening
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88777704476673
    m_Localized: Every time 3 allied pieces are defeated, can move and attack like
      a [Queen] for the rest of that turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1511529955060351072
  - m_Id: 88777704476674
    m_Localized: The conditions are not met, so this skill cannot be used.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16691838908502016
    m_Localized: Split
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16691838979805184
    m_Localized: Removes itself and creates 1 Jellu [Pawn] on its original tile and
      1 on an adjacent empty tile. Both inherit its Traits and receive [Attack Disabled]
      for 1 turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1511529955060351073
  - m_Id: 16691838979805185
    m_Localized: Split cannot be used because it would exceed the maximum piece capacity.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16691840000000001
    m_Localized: 'Synthesis: Reinforce'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16691840000000002
    m_Localized: Absorbs and removes 1 random adjacent allied [Pawn]. Gains [Breakthrough]
      and [Evasion] for 1 turn each.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1511529955060351074
  - m_Id: 16691840000000003
    m_Localized: There is no adjacent allied [Pawn] that can be absorbed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
